# Kamal secrets for every destination and both services. This file is tracked and holds
# NO values: each line only reads an environment variable of the same name. CI fills them
# from the GitHub environment (staging / production) secrets; an operator exports them in
# a shell before running kamal by hand. Never write a literal secret here.

KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD

